Status bar icons for the phone mockup, taken from the Android Open Source Project,
frameworks/base/core/res/res/drawable, converted from vector drawables to SVG paths with no
other change. Used as CSS masks, so the fill colour comes from tokens.css.

  wifi.svg     ic_wifi_signal_4.xml            Copyright (C) 2015 The Android Open Source Project
  signal.svg   ic_signal_cellular_4_4_bar.xml  Copyright (C) 2019 The Android Open Source Project
  battery.svg  ic_battery.xml                  Copyright (C) 2018 The Android Open Source Project

